message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DSSE-Net: A Compact Depthwise Squeeze-and-Excitation Network for Patient-Level Brain Tumor Classification"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: MIT

authors:
