    given-names: "Alzubair"
    affiliation: "Erciyes University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6117-8051"

  - family-names: "Ozturk"
    given-names: "Serkan"
    affiliation: "Erciyes University"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Alzubair98/DSSE-Net-Brain-MRI-Classification"
url: "https://github.com/Alzubair98/DSSE-Net-Brain-MRI-Classification"

abstract: >-
  PyTorch implementation of DSSE-Net, a compact residual-free depthwise
  squeeze-and-excitation network for patient-level brain tumor classification
  from contrast-enhanced MRI. The repository includes preprocessing, manual
  quality-control manifests, nested stratified patient-level 5x5
  cross-validation, ablation experiments, baseline comparisons, statistical
  analysis, and Grad-CAM visualization.

keywords:
  - brain tumor classification
  - magnetic resonance imaging
  - deep learning
  - patient-level cross-validation
  - depthwise convolution
  - squeeze-and-excitation
  - Grad-CAM
